{"text": " Cu 67.000 de euro mai g\u0103se\u0219ti un apartament nou \u00een Bucure\u0219ti? Da, \u00een cel mai nou ansamblu reziden\u021bial din zona Titan. Apartamentele sunt disponibile direct de la dezvoltatori, zilor la sut\u0103 comisiuni, iar \u00een aceast\u0103 perioad\u0103 pot beneficia de un discount valabil pentru un num\u0103r limitat de unit\u0103\u021bi. Ai la dispozi\u021bie studiouri \u0219i apartamente cu 2, 3 sau 4 camere, cu terase generoase, spa\u021bii verzi \u0219i un loc de joac\u0103. \u00cen plus, proiectul beneficiaz\u0103 de acces rapid c\u0103tre Parcul Ioref, centre comerciale \u0219i principalele puncte de interes \u00een zona. Dac\u0103 vrei s\u0103 afli ce apartamente mai sunt disponibile \u0219i s\u0103 programezi o vizionare, completeaz\u0103 formularul iar noi te vom contacta \u00een cel mai scurt timp.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 3.24, "text": " Cu 67.000 de euro mai g\u0103se\u0219ti un apartament nou \u00een Bucure\u0219ti?", "tokens": [50364, 13205, 23879, 13, 1360, 368, 14206, 12698, 290, 4089, 405, 10355, 7317, 517, 4936, 2466, 23641, 15351, 363, 1311, 540, 10355, 7317, 30, 50526], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18675359698573937, "compression_ratio": 1.6299212598425197, "no_speech_prob": 0.01605069451034069}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 3.24, "end": 5.96, "text": " Da, \u00een cel mai nou ansamblu reziden\u021bial din zona Titan.", "tokens": [50526, 3933, 11, 15351, 9277, 12698, 23641, 1567, 2173, 2781, 48060, 4380, 15918, 831, 3791, 24848, 17731, 13, 50662], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18675359698573937, "compression_ratio": 1.6299212598425197, "no_speech_prob": 0.01605069451034069}, {"id": 2, "seek": 0, "start": 5.96, "end": 8.6, "text": " Apartamentele sunt disponibile direct de la dezvoltatori,", "tokens": [50662, 24111, 3439, 306, 35171, 23311, 30898, 2047, 368, 635, 45057, 47610, 39842, 11, 50794], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18675359698573937, "compression_r